					<div class="admin_txt"><h3><b>Co135 Classic Portal with interlocking doors system</b></h3>
<p><b>High security portal with square base, single person passage checking system and abandoned item detection.</b> Mantrap with interlocking doors, designed as access control gate for: banks, financial institutes, companies, embassies, datacenters, prisons, miisteries, jewelleries and value protection areas. The second door opens only if control systems give positive result.</p>
<p>Fully self-managed. Person transit automatically managed, with voice commands during the transit steps (multilanguage messages). It can be equipped with <b>metal detector</b> and <b>access control systems</b> such as: badge readers, RFIDs, NFCs, fingerprints and/or anti-masking systems.</p>
<p><b>Three models:</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Co135.60: W 1050 * D 1050 * H 2400 mm | Passage: L 600 * H 2000 mm</li>
<li>Co135.R60: W 1050 * D 1050 * H 2340 mm | Passage: L 600 * H2010 mm<br />R = Ribassata (lowered)</li>
</ul></div>
